        <body>
            <div xml:id="d248">

                <pb facs="0444" n="340" sameAs="frus:frus1890/pg340"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Lincoln to Mr. Blaine.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1890-05-28"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 28, 1890</date>.
                        (Received June 5.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 249.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to your instruction numbered 255
                    of the 6th instant and to my dispatch numbered 229 of 5th instant, I have the
                    honor to inclose herewith the copy of a note which I have just received from the
                    Marquis of Salisbury relative to Venezuela in reply to mine of the 5th of this
                    month, a copy of which was forwarded to you in my dispatch above mentioned.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert T.
                    Lincoln.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d248-a1.xml" xpointer="d248-a1"/>
